TI  - Prophenoloxidase activation is required for survival to microbial infections in Drosophila
AN  - 24788090
DO  - 10.1371/journal.ppat.1004067
IS  - 5
VL  - 10
DA  - 2014/05
PY  - 2014
T2  - PLoS pathogens
J2  - PLoS Pathog
SN  - 1553-7366
